link><description>RadixArk 发布 27B 参数模型 DaisyRose，探索用更少的后训练投入换取更强的模型表现。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 19:54:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f689168723dc030df68e3b673ab44c5f35046795</guid><source url="https://huggingface.co/blog/RadixArk/daisyrose-27b-pushing-the-frontier-of-post-trainin">Hugging Face Blog</source></item><item><title>Pydantic AI v2.71.0 发布</title><link>https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0</link><description>Pydantic AI 2.71.0 版上线，改动集中在多智能体对等网络的连接方式与接口命名，并接入新的模型服务商 Stav。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 02:13:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">77770fa210de2552a66026b4560552e3450b3250</guid><source url="https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.71.0">Pydantic AI Releases</source></item><item><title>GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 接入 GitHub Copilot</title><link>https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available</link><description>OpenAI 的 GPT-6.2 Astra 与 Sol 已在 GitHub Copilot 全面可用，面向智能体编程与代码评审做了强化。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 20:20:29 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">96ff71f54c6e7b4da47668acaa4a513b0085cd1a</guid><source url="https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-17-openais-gpt-6-2-astra-and-gpt-6-2-sol-now-available">GitHub Copilot Changelog</source></item><item><title>Claude Code 2.1.327 发布</title><link>https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327</link><description>Claude Code 2.1.327 在安装 GitHub 应用改动仓库前先征求确认，并让 MCP 服务器配置可从标准输入读取 JSON。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 23:22:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b7a7366c72677641c0dd7f4007e9797114b8bbe</guid><source url="https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog#2-1-327">Claude Code Changelog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code v0.28.1 预览版</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0</link><description>Qwen Code 的预览更新，验证了托管智能体的定时任务触发，并加固了状态检查与容器配置。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 19:56:30 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">564aa296ded401b85b17beac2a3926158ef632e6</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.1-preview.0">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code TypeScript SDK v0.1.35</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.35</link><description>Qwen Code 的 TypeScript 软件包更新到 0.1.35，捆绑的命令行版本同步到 0.28.0。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:07:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">55d604a6c28c10311e2a998c268322e38b117af0</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/sdk-typescript-v0.1.35">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>LangSmith 面向编码智能体：按成果追踪花费</title><link>https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi</link><description>LangSmith 为编码智能体新增报表能力，把智能体的花费与它产出的拉取请求挂钩，方便团队按实际成果衡量投入。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 15:00:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">6985c741cc7eaaabeaaf9f18e65ae45fa5f5acf9</guid><source url="https://www.langchain.com/blog/langsmith-coding-agents-roi">LangChain Blog</source></item><item><title>Qwen Code 每夜构建 v0.28.0-nightly.20261118</title><link>https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f</link><description>Qwen Code 发布新一期每夜构建，改进托管智能体的定时循环测试，并加固 PR 校验的状态守卫与容器逻辑。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 22:29:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2cde799921c8c7805802a15d870fa67af71a9275</guid><source url="https://github.com/QwenLM/qwen-code/releases/tag/v0.28.0-nightly.20261118.d9ac287c9f">Qwen Code Releases</source></item><item><title>研究加速：参差不齐的 AI 前沿</title><link>https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-jagged-frontier</link><description>OpenAI 通过实测评估编程智能体对 AI 研究的加速作用，发现其能力提升并不均匀，并讨论了这种趋势对研究自我加速的意义。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">9fa731b0ef6c1da92e2ee19dd39d37ee6fef6c75</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/research-acceleration-jagged-frontier">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>住友生命高管带队落地 ChatGPT Enterprise</title><link>https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/sumitomo-life</link><description>住友生命高管率先使用 ChatGPT Enterprise，带动团队用它做保险公司调研、准备提案和编写投资分析代码。</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b527b6f0ddceafec7084d672744f5ae005b63c0e</guid><source url="https://openai.com/business/customer-stories/sumitomo-life">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>OpenAI 推出 ChatGPT for Sales，面向销售团队的新插件</title><link>https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-for-sales</link><description>ChatGPT 新增面向销售场景的插件，并接入 30 多个新增与扩展的合作方插件，帮助销售团队调研客户、准备推介、同步客户关系数据并推进成交。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c6c361c53bc4ce2d407e4ebf6ba55c1f510e586f</guid><source url="https://openai.com/index/introducing-chatgpt-for-sales">OpenAI News</source></item><item><title>Devin 推出 Devin Bots</title><link>https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots</link><description>Devin Bots 是能为目标负责的工程队友，会带领一队 Devin 去交付成果，而不只是接单做任务。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">053a7a9d8ca5a8c12607b3d6e73dfbed9fd20802</guid><source url="https://devin.ai/blog/introducing-devin-bots">Devin Blog</source></item></channel></rss>
